["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI Is Rewriting the Power Law of Venture Capital power law death of the middle TPPI vintage ARR LBO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-a16z-ai-让风投的幂律变得更极端-而不是更温和/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">49:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>AI 让风投的幂律变得更极端，而不是更温和</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">3000 家风投里只有 20 家连续二十年做到 3 倍净回报。AI 第一次让钱能直接换成算力、算力直接变成产品优势，幂律因此更陡，而非更平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 配置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Coinbase’s Everything Exchange: Agentic Finance, Stablecoins, and Tokenization with CEO Brian Armstrong Everything Exchange X402 agentic finance epigenetic reprogramming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-nopriors-给-ai-代理开户-信用卡手续费撑不起机器经济/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f9f8b9697bf1eed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">45:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>给 AI 代理开户：信用卡手续费撑不起机器经济</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coinbase 想让每个 AI 代理都有自己的账户：76% 的机器支付在 30 美分以下，而信用卡的最低手续费恰好就是 30 美分——旧支付轨道撑不起机器经济。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">加密支付</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 代理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Finances of Marriage | Rational Reminder 426 tight wad spendthrift unconflicted consumer financial infidelity prenup\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-rationalreminder-结婚前先做花钱测试-紧手和挥霍者互相吸引-也更容易离婚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad3115003cac32ae-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>结婚前先做花钱测试：紧手和挥霍者互相吸引，也更容易离婚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究把花钱的人分成紧手和挥霍者，两端的人更容易互相吸引，但婚后金钱冲突更多、婚姻满意度更低；婚礼花得越多，离婚风险反而越高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人财务</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Finances of Marriage | #426 tightwad spendthrift anticipatory pain of paying financial infidelity unconflicted consumer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-rationalreminder-婚礼花得越多离婚率越高-最省的那批人反而最稳/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>婚礼花得越多离婚率越高，最省的那批人反而最稳</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究显示婚礼花费越低离婚率越低，低于一千美元的那批人离婚率最低；而订婚戒指花得越多，男性离婚风险越高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">婚姻财务</span><span class=\"tag\">消费心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Predatory Industry Behind MLB’s Dominican Superstar Pipeline early agreement international draft signing bonus Dominican Summer League\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-papertrail-mlb-在多米尼加建了棒球城堡-也养出了放贷人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed1b4a79f40f86fd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">44:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Paper Trail</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>MLB 在多米尼加建了棒球城堡，也养出了放贷人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">MLB 每年在多米尼加投入高达 4 亿美元，却没有选秀、允许 16 岁前私下签约，于是催生了一个向球员家庭放高利贷的影子产业，而 David Ortiz 被指是其中一环。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">体育产业</span><span class=\"tag\">调查报道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Where Have The Insects Gone?? With Dr. Jessica Ware colony collapse disorder Varroa mite neonicotinoid pollinator garden oothika spiracles\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-sciencevs-昆虫正在消失-但杀虫剂不是最大凶手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/632ea71d96602758-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>昆虫正在消失，但杀虫剂不是最大凶手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">昆虫数量下降被反复质疑夸大，但全球数据仍在指向同一方向；真正被低估的凶手不是农业，而是普通人随手买来用的杀虫剂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生态</span><span class=\"tag\">昆虫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E909.我们给残障人写「爽文」戏剧，把健全人写成弱势群体 原罪人 镜面人 口述影像\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-cn907a40-残障剧团让健全人当被歧视的少数-不是要你同情/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b8c6d4c5deab1aa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">41:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>残障剧团让健全人当被歧视的少数，不是要你同情</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">妖妖把社会关系整个调转过来：核战后多数人成了改造人，少数没改造的健全人成了原罪人，要争取权利的反倒是他们。这不是诉苦，是给残障人写的爽文。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">残障</span><span class=\"tag\">戏剧</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Archive: Plato&#x27;s Republic Thrasymachus the Forms the cave the ring of Gyges tripartite soul demagogue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-inourtime-柏拉图理想国-民主离暴政只差一个煽动家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b92ca842f2a04535-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">50:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">In Our Time</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>柏拉图理想国：民主离暴政只差一个煽动家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柏拉图认为民主制内部就埋着滑向暴政的通道，被野心家利用只是时间问题；而正义不是外在行为，是灵魂内部的秩序。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">政治哲学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Essentials: Genes &amp; the Inheritance of Memories Across Generations | Dr. Oded Rechavi Weismann barrier C. elegans small RNAs RNA interference epigenetic reprogramming\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-huberman-获得性遗传在线虫已被证实-人类还没有证据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8f8083a6d5296169-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">35:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Huberman Lab</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>获得性遗传在线虫已被证实，人类还没有证据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">教科书用魏斯曼屏障解释为什么练出的肌肉传不下去；但在线虫里，敲掉后代自己造小 RNA 的能力，它们仍能抵抗父母遇过的病毒，只改大脑里的 RNA 就能改变三代后的行为。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">表观遗传</span><span class=\"tag\">线虫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Robert A. Wilson, &quot;Kin Matters: Relational Beings in the Fragile Sciences&quot; (Oxford UP, 2026) progenerative view Westermark hypothesis separatism extended cognition homeostatic property cluster disciplinary groove\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-nbphilosophy-亲属关系不是文化发明-而是生殖事实的文化延展/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1c8789e8a81bb90f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">New Books in Philosophy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>亲属关系不是文化发明，而是生殖事实的文化延展</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人类学家说亲属关系纯属文化建构，哲学家却指出：女性先怀孕后生育这类生殖事实跨文化通用，亲属制度是对它们的文化延展，连乱伦回避也不是人类独有。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人类学</span><span class=\"tag\">亲属关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of Organized Retail Crime at Big Box Stores shrink ORC (organized retail crime) boosters fence INFORM Act edge analytics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-oddlots-偷来的货能卖到原价七八折-零售盗窃已经产业化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>偷来的货能卖到原价七八折，零售盗窃已经产业化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被盗商品要经过两层手：boosters 被招募进店偷货，fence 负责清洗标识和转售，之后挂上二手平台。联网的赃物能卖到原价七八折，T 恤和除臭剂只剩三成多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售损耗</span><span class=\"tag\">有组织零售犯罪</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How baseball got its beat walk-up song seventh inning stretch Tin Pan Alley closer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-throughline-棒球场的音乐不是伴奏-是球迷抢回比赛的方式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f35a52e32ee13fa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">32:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>棒球场的音乐不是伴奏，是球迷抢回比赛的方式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">棒球官方史学家嫌球场音乐太吵，但正是球迷齐唱 Hey Hey Goodbye 把客队投手唱到手软——音乐让观众从看客变成比赛的一部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">棒球</span><span class=\"tag\">现场体验</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Iron Age Ireland sacral kingship Fianna currach opidum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-ancients-爱尔兰铁器时代没有凯尔特人入侵-只有贸易和语言/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef50c48b77dede87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>爱尔兰铁器时代没有凯尔特人入侵，只有贸易和语言</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传统说法认为凯尔特人带着铁器在公元前500年入侵爱尔兰，但考古几乎找不到外来移民的痕迹——凯尔特身份其实是青铜时代晚期海上贸易网络里慢慢长出来的语言共同体。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">爱尔兰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Battle of Stamford Bridge Explained berserk chape house carls Varangian Guard Doomsday Book\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-10-historyhit-斯坦福桥大捷被黑斯廷斯一笔勾销-考古刚找到战场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc50d2d1c5ba1e0e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">31:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>斯坦福桥大捷被黑斯廷斯一笔勾销，考古刚找到战场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1066年9月，英王哈罗德四天急行军约200英里，全歼哈拉尔德·哈德拉达的维京大军；但这场足以奠定任何君主声望的胜利，几天后就被黑斯廷斯的惨败彻底抹去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">维京时代</span><span class=\"tag\">1066年</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"394. Road To 9/11: Hijackers, CIA Failures, and America’s Darkest Day (Part 6) cock-up view of history muscle hijackers casing videotape the wall ghazia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-empirehist-cia-提前数月警告-白宫为何还是没拦住-9-11/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">46:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>CIA 提前数月警告，白宫为何还是没拦住 9/11</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">情报系统把战略预警做到了极致，但决策者可以选择无视——这是 9/11 前七个月真正的失败点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情报失灵</span><span class=\"tag\">组织决策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"704. Roman Civil War: Master of the Republic (Part 4) proscription lictor tribunate adulescentulus carnifex Campus Martius\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-restishistory-苏拉用血洗罗马-却亲手为凯撒铺好了路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>苏拉用血洗罗马，却亲手为凯撒铺好了路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏拉是第一个带兵打进罗马的人，他赢了内战、当上独裁官、又主动退位。但他打破的禁忌再也收不回来——凯撒说他是傻瓜，因为他交出了独裁权。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">罗马史</span><span class=\"tag\">内战</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Considering a Career Change? How About FINFLUENCER? finfluencer RIA Roth IRA cringe phase top of funnel W-2\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-mastersinbiz-做金融网红不是当网红-是把社媒当漏斗顶端/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fb210b1031bb956-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">30:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>做金融网红不是当网红，是把社媒当漏斗顶端</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tyler Gardner 从教师转行做理财顾问，再转做金融内容，做到 600 万粉丝。他的判断是：短视频只是漏斗顶端，真正的资产是你能自己拥有的邮件列表和长内容。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">个人品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">金融内容</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"5 Solo Founders Called In With Their Hardest Problem | Solo Founders Office Hours RL environment jobs to be done GMV ERP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-solofounders-单人创始人最缺的不是人手-是有人逼你说真话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9f64dfbc7c597bfb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">47:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>单人创始人最缺的不是人手，是有人逼你说真话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Julian 给五位单人创始人的诊断几乎都指向同一件事：没有联合创始人，你就失去了那个逼你面对「今天到底做了什么」的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创业</span><span class=\"tag\">早期融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"11 Marketing Rules every Creator needs to know: Kate Tolo bouncer ticket price yes and\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-colinsamir-把内容当夜店-算法是保安-你唯一的工作是让他放你进去/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac1190aacdd40897-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">53:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Colin and Samir</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>把内容当夜店：算法是保安，你唯一的工作是让他放你进去</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kate Tolo 用五年把 Brian Johnson 从 2000 粉做到千万粉，她的核心比喻是：算法是夜店保安，只在乎场内的人玩得开不开心，你失败一百次也没人看见。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内容策略</span><span class=\"tag\">增长</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Can AI help us better predict the weather? numerical weather prediction GraphCast GenCast functional generative networks spaghetti plots load forecasting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-deepmind-ai-预报飓风提前一周锁定五级-靠的是统计不是物理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.simplecastcdn.com/images/69d76c2c-4017-4f2f-8838-a33d03d55657/ba57c63a-db75-4c9c-a506-a4bba82c41d1/3000x3000/cropped_1788889769029.jpg?aid=rss_feed\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Google DeepMind</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>AI 预报飓风提前一周锁定五级，靠的是统计不是物理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">传统数值预报靠解流体方程，AI 靠从历史天气里学统计规律。飓风 Melissa 在还是热带低压时就被模型以约 80% 置信度锁定为五级，比传统模型更早更狠。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 天气预测</span><span class=\"tag\">DeepMind</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Ashurbanipal cuneiform colophon Neo-Assyrian Sardanapalus Bisitun inscription\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-stuffmissed-亚述巴尼拔的图书馆-他既是暴君-也是最早的藏书家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">37:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>亚述巴尼拔的图书馆：他既是暴君，也是最早的藏书家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">亚述巴尼拔一边把敌国国王关进狗窝、逼人用祖先骨头做砖，一边建起人类最早的系统性图书馆，让《吉尔伽美什史诗》活到今天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史</span><span class=\"tag\">考古</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Jared Diamond on Leaders, Luck, and Irreplaceability environmental Kuznets curve natural experiments Dvorak keyboard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-tyler-没有不可替代的领袖-只有不可替代的运气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2d90e9a992692a3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>没有不可替代的领袖，只有不可替代的运气</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴蒙德研究领袖五十年，结论是长期看没有哪个领袖不可替代——成吉思汗只是恰好生在两千年来最湿润的草原上，换个人也许一样。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">领导力</span><span class=\"tag\">历史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"When will average people feel AI’s impact? Engels’ pause Navier-Stokes Millennium Prize Problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-interconnects-ai-对普通人是舍入误差-扩散要五十年-反弹却等不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2ea9ccfe0923b7a0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">8:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>AI 对普通人是舍入误差：扩散要五十年，反弹却等不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工业革命给普通人便宜衣服和缝纫机，AI 目前只给普通人好玩的图片和更好的搜索——好处太间接，而政治反弹来得太快。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 扩散</span><span class=\"tag\">公众认知</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Grades the AI Models? | Ben Horowitz &amp; Rayan Krishnan held-out private benchmarks recursive self-improvement (RSI) reward hacking token maxing harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-a16z-公开榜单测不出模型真实能力-第三方评测才是刚需/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>公开榜单测不出模型真实能力，第三方评测才是刚需</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Llama 4 在公开榜单上表现惊人，在 Vals 的私有留出集上却是不达标——自报成绩和真实能力之间的裂缝，正在催生一个独立的评测行业。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI评测</span><span class=\"tag\">基准测试</span>\n</div></div></a>"]